  "title": "Your \"Not Enrolled for E-Pay\" Status Is Costing You Donors",
  "summary": "Electronic payment enrollment with your major DAF payers is not a technical upgrade—it's a fundraising strategy. It removes friction at the exact moment a donor is ready to give, gets gifts and data into your hands faster so you can steward relationships while they're warm, and—with Fidelity Charitable's July 2026 deadline—will soon be the difference between receiving grants from the country's largest DAF sponsor and not.",
